f Justice of the European Union, as review organization, are the following : Email: GC.Registry@curia.europa.eu /  Telephone: +352 4303-1."},{"field":"tenderer_requirement","lang":"ENG","lot":null,"value":"For the full list of exclusion grounds please consult the procurement documents."},{"field":"title","lang":"ENG","lot":null,"value":"High-level advice and consultancy services (HACS)"},{"field":"description","lang":"ENG","lot":"LOT-0001","value":"Multiple FWCs for the provision of advisory/consultancy services (high-level consultancy and studies), ensuring business continuity after the expiration of the framework contracts under Lot 2 of ‘BEACON - Benchmarking, Advisory and Consultancy Services in Information and Communication Technology' resulting from the DIGIT/2020/OP/0005 – Benchmarking, Advisory and Consultancy Services in Information and Communication Technology – Lot 1 and Lot 2 Call for Tenders published in 2021.\n\nAs described above, the main scope of the new HACS procedure is the replacement of BEACON lot 2, considering that, under the original BEACON framework contracts, the majority of the services were ordered under lot 2. While BEACON lot 1 is not scheduled for replacement as a separate lot or procedure, the technical scope of services previously ordered under BEACON lot 1 will also be covered by the new procedure. Consequently, the new HACS procedure is not split into lots.\n\nPlease note that the phone number and email address of the Court of Justice of the European Union, as review organization, are the following : Email: GC.Registry@curia.europa.eu /  Telephone: +352 4303-1."},{"field":"title","lang":"ENG","lot":"LOT-0001","value":"High-level advice and consultancy services (HACS)"}],"title":"High-level advice and consultancy services (HACS)","value":{"cents":24331726700,"currency":"EUR"},"value_derivation":null,"version":5,"versions":[{"caused_by_notice_id":24831618,"dispatched_at":"2025-07-17T10:12:17+02:00","notice_subtype":"16","original_lan